{"id":"660678","name":"酸豆角炒蛋","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"","cover":"images/660678/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"酸豆角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"青线椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"腌制好的酸豆角适量。","img":"images/660678/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋磕在碗中，加盐、料酒、少许水打散。","img":"images/660678/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"青线椒去籽洗净切小段。","img":"images/660678/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放油烧热，倒入蛋液炒凝固盛出。","img":"images/660678/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"另放油，放入酸豆角翻炒均匀，加少许水烧几分钟。","img":"images/660678/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入青线椒炒熟。","img":"images/660678/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"合入蛋块炒匀。","img":"images/660678/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"酸咸爽口，很下饭。","img":"images/660678/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}